ne","uncertainty_reason":"mixed_signals","decision_rationale":"The abstract explicitly describes a \"novel encoder-decoder architecture\" and self-supervised latent representation learning, which supports a generative architecture. It also shows broad applicability across multimillion-cell datasets and Slide-seqV2, but the record mixes in unrelated protein-generation text, so the paper identity is inconsistent.","evidence_snippet":"\"novel encoder-decoder architecture\"; \"self-supervised framework for learning latent representations\"; \"capable of domain discovery in wholebrain Slide-seqV2 datasets\"; \"protein language model generations\"; \"structure-based generative model\"; \"not_assessed\"; \"not_assessed\"; \"not_assessed\"; \"generative_boundary\""},"python_gate":{"provisional_decision":"ADJUDICATE","provisional_code":"EC2_no_text_component","adjudication_reason":"criterion_unclear_or_reviewer_conflict","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","generative_model_present":"yes","foundation_model_evidence":"yes"}}}]

